  "content": "<p align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/29VEnDg.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n\n<center><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZWKmEPkPd7Xt8fkKVeBzTQ\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCZWKmEPkPd7Xt8fkKVeBzTQ?color=9a7daa&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/izofar/bastille-blues\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/plays-4.8k-594058?logo=soundcloud&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/izofar43\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/followers-39-9a7daa?logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/izofar/bygone-nether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/izofar/takes-a-pillage?color=594058&amp;label=license&amp;logo=github&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/it-takes-a-pillage/files\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.0.3-9a7daa?label=Version&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a></center>\n</br>\n\n## 📖 關於本模組：\n\n> *這是一個針對1.16.5+版本的掠奪者擴展模組，旨在強化掠奪者文明體系，同時為生存模式帶來更具挑戰性與沉浸感的遊戲體驗。*\n\n掠奪者的文明版圖已全面擴張！他們在世界各地建立了營地與堡壘！你是否能戰勝這些新威脅，奪取他們的珍貴戰利品？詳情請見圖片預覽！\n\n原聲帶請至[SoundCloud](https://soundcloud.com/izofar)收聽。這是我首個正式發布的模組，歡迎關注我的其他作品！**您的支持將幫助我投入更多時間進行更新與除錯。**\n\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\" />\n\n## 🎥 宣傳影片：\n\n<center><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ElrvaNwvEHs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></center>\n\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\" />\n\n## ❗&nbsp;必要前置模組：\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/9tshDxW.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/pKf97it.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.20.1.html)\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/b1sKEDp.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/NFDhQUd.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.19.2.html)\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/ek7ODYh.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/ZVo2Y5w.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.18.2.html)\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmJfA0d.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/LK6Yi7Q.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.16.5.html)\n* 無其他強制依賴模組！\n\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\" />\n\n## 📦 相容模組列表：\n\n完整相容清單請見[CurseForge專頁](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/it-takes-a-pillage)！\n\n## 🕷&nbsp;錯誤回報專區：\n\n<a href=\"https://github.com/izofar/takes-a-pillage\"><img src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/pin/?username=izofar&amp;repo=takes-a-pillage&amp;title_color=ffd556&amp;text_color=eee&amp;bg_color=000&amp;icon_color=9a7daa\" /></a>\n\n## ✔️ 已知問題修正：\n> 簡而言之：請更新模組與Forge版本！\n\n詳細修正建議請參閱[CurseForge專頁](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/it-takes-a-pillage)的說明！\n\n## 特別致謝：\n\n開發過程中特別感謝Mod Development Discord的Telepathic Grunt、Sizable Shrimp、Commoble與Cadiboo提供的技術指導。\n\n特別感謝ZestyBlaze完成本模組的Fabric移植版本！",
